2026-11-05T14:07:04.8418436Z A red here is owed a fix and a PROOF, not an explanation. Fix the lane, then verify it on the default branch:
2026-11-05T14:07:04.8419774Z     gh workflow run nightly.yml --ref main
2026-11-05T14:07:04.8422299Z and name that run id under `## Red checks` in your pull-request body. A concluded dispatch on the default branch is read as the nightly here, so the check goes green on the fix rather than on the next cron.
